rix is $T$. What should be placed into the blank space to make a true statement?" 13194139533358 17592186045585 true] [17592186124442 1072 #uuid "427d3dc9-9ae8-5c40-b75c-519db84f2bc6" 13194139533358 17592186045585 true] [17592186124442 1074 "Recall that the *invertible matrix theorem* (in terms of linear transformations) states the following:\n\n> $\\mathbf{T}$ is a bijection $Im (T) = R^{n}; rank(T) = n; Ker(T) = {0}; nullity(T) = 0$\n> $\\qquad \\Longleftrightarrow \\qquad$ $T$ is invertible\n\nTherefore, the missing expression is $\\textrm{Im}(\\mathbf{T})$." 13194139533358 17592186045585 true] [17592186124443 1037 #edb/ref 17592186048713 13194139533358 17592186045585 true] [17592186124443 1038 #edb/ref 17592186124963 13194139533358 17592186045585 true] [17592186124443 1038 #edb/ref 17592186124993 13194139533358 17592186045585 true] [17592186124443 1039 "Finding the Slope of the Tangent Line to a Curve at a Point" 13194139533358 17592186045585 true] [17592186124443 1041 #edb/ref 17592186124247 13194139533358 17592186045585 true] [17592186124443 1042 #uuid "049e8586-8348-50be-ac56-4ea79eba43cd" 13194139533358 17592186045585 true] [17592186124444 1037 #edb/ref 17592186050641 13194139533358 17592186045585 true] [17592186124444 1038 #edb/ref 17592186124964 13194139533358 17592186045585 true] [17592186124444 1038 #edb/ref 17592186124982 13194139533358 17592186045585 true] [17592186124444 1039 "Finding the Equation of the Tangent Line to a Curve at a Point" 13194139533358 17592186045585 true] [17592186124444 1041 #edb/ref 17592186124248 13194139533358 17592186045585 true] [17592186124444 1042 #uuid "4c5685f7-71b2-58ae-8c61-f555b355d92f" 13194139533358 17592186045585 true] [17592186124445 1037 #edb/ref 17592186050997 13194139533358 17592186045585 true] [17592186124445 1038 #edb/ref 17592186124983 13194139533358 17592186045585 true] [17592186124445 1038 #edb/ref 17592186125189 13194139533358 17592186045585 true] [17592186124445 1039 "Finding the Tangent Vector to a Curve